<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-INDIA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India beat Zimbabwe by seven wickets in the fourth match of the Singer World Series one-day limited overs cricket tournament on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 226 in 49.4 overs, India 229-3 in 43.5 overs.</p>
